WEBVTT

00:00:19.350 --> 00:00:21.770
The world is in the Gourmet Age.

00:00:22.530 --> 00:00:25.370
Gourmet Hunters are explorers 
who travel the world,

00:00:25.370 --> 00:00:28.940
searching for your ingredients.

00:00:30.110 --> 00:00:32.810
And the ingredient at 
the top of this world

00:00:33.210 --> 00:00:35.350
is GOD, which is being sought

00:00:35.350 --> 00:00:38.110
by one Gourmet Hunter.

00:00:44.340 --> 00:00:47.190
Go! Shock!! Gourmet!! Gourmet!!

00:00:51.020 --> 00:00:53.700
Go! Shock!!

00:00:55.460 --> 00:00:58.270
Friends who can eat the same dream

00:00:58.270 --> 00:01:01.070
Friends who share the same future

00:01:01.360 --> 00:01:03.820
With you guys

00:01:03.820 --> 00:01:06.790
It’s first-rate gourmet my way!

00:01:06.800 --> 00:01:09.770
If we join forces

00:01:09.770 --> 00:01:12.530
We’ll be invincible

00:01:12.530 --> 00:01:15.850
Come on, let’s show ‘em

00:01:17.900 --> 00:01:23.460
Delicious food gives life

00:01:23.870 --> 00:01:29.100
So be thankful for everything and

00:01:29.100 --> 00:01:31.070
Let’s eat!!

00:01:31.070 --> 00:01:34.070
We can’t lose!! We can’t be stopped!!

00:01:34.070 --> 00:01:37.080
We ain’t gonna let ‘em have that

00:01:37.980 --> 00:01:42.450
We’re gonna win it!! Shock! 
Shock! Gourmet king!!

00:01:42.450 --> 00:01:45.320
Spiked Punch!! Infinity!!

00:01:45.320 --> 00:01:49.050
I’ll punch through with this fist

00:01:49.290 --> 00:01:52.960
First-rate gourmet my way!

00:01:53.160 --> 00:01:56.130
Let’s gather ‘round the table

00:01:56.130 --> 00:02:00.030
For the sake of tomorrow

00:02:00.220 --> 00:02:02.280
Let’s go! Go! Gourmet!!

00:02:07.910 --> 00:02:12.590
Gourmet Corp. invaded the Fest 
in order to capture the chefs.

00:02:12.590 --> 00:02:15.870
Toriko hammered Starjun 
with all of his attacks,

00:02:15.870 --> 00:02:17.080
to no avail!

00:02:18.200 --> 00:02:22.480
Meanwhile, the chefs fought an 
uphill battle against the Nitro.

00:02:23.050 --> 00:02:25.740
Komatsu escaped on his own.

00:02:26.590 --> 00:02:31.950
And the fierce battle between 
Coco and Grinpatch unfolded.

00:02:34.580 --> 00:02:37.830
Mortal Combat! Coco vs. Grinpatch!

00:02:53.850 --> 00:02:56.280
Hey, come on! You're joking, right?

00:02:56.280 --> 00:02:59.090
You're not really groggy yet, are you?

00:02:59.560 --> 00:03:01.390
Of course not.

00:03:03.390 --> 00:03:04.600
Eat this...

00:03:05.230 --> 00:03:06.400
Poison Cannon!

00:03:08.530 --> 00:03:09.370
What?!

00:03:11.300 --> 00:03:14.110
I ate it, just as I was told!

00:03:14.110 --> 00:03:16.070
Thanks for the food!

00:03:16.450 --> 00:03:18.380
He even swallowed my Poison Cannon?!

00:03:20.310 --> 00:03:22.050
Now this is how...

00:03:22.380 --> 00:03:24.120
...you fire a cannon!

00:03:24.420 --> 00:03:26.080
Breath Bazooka!

00:03:35.630 --> 00:03:38.160
S-So powerful...

00:03:38.160 --> 00:03:40.980
But that's to be expected of 
a Gourmet Corp. Vice-chef.

00:03:41.710 --> 00:03:42.730
Even so...

00:03:43.740 --> 00:03:45.340
...I can't afford to lose here!

00:03:47.510 --> 00:03:49.910
That's the spirit!

00:03:49.910 --> 00:03:53.460
Machine Gun Poison, double barrel barrage!

00:03:54.780 --> 00:03:57.450
What, you're out of new attacks already?

00:03:57.780 --> 00:04:00.280
Just hitting with me twice as much

00:04:00.280 --> 00:04:02.490
won't work!

00:04:08.180 --> 00:04:10.240
Thanks!

00:04:10.430 --> 00:04:12.030
Poison Sword!

00:04:15.600 --> 00:04:18.870
You won't be able to suck up 
my poison without that straw!

00:04:20.870 --> 00:04:22.570
It's still in one piece!

00:04:34.720 --> 00:04:36.690
This straw

00:04:36.690 --> 00:04:40.060
is coated with the sap of

00:04:40.060 --> 00:04:42.160
the Gourmet World's Rock Oak,

00:04:42.160 --> 00:04:46.400
which is hundreds of times 
harder than diamond.

00:04:46.760 --> 00:04:49.770
It can't be cut through so easily.

00:04:49.770 --> 00:04:52.240
In that case, I'll chop up your body!

00:04:54.670 --> 00:04:55.670
Forget about it!

00:05:12.320 --> 00:05:15.090
Crap. My arm...

00:05:15.460 --> 00:05:17.630
Looks like you bit off 
more than you could chew.

00:05:18.430 --> 00:05:20.800
I don't believe you have the 
strength to attack anymore.

00:05:22.170 --> 00:05:24.210
You did show me a good time

00:05:24.640 --> 00:05:27.110
with your full course of attacks.

00:05:27.110 --> 00:05:27.980
However...

00:05:27.980 --> 00:05:31.560
...you didn't quite satisfy my hunger.

00:05:44.060 --> 00:05:46.460
There isn't anywhere to escape to!

00:05:46.460 --> 00:05:47.590
Nowhere!

00:06:05.240 --> 00:06:06.480
Like that one time...

00:06:25.530 --> 00:06:26.460
Yun!

00:06:27.630 --> 00:06:29.830
Y-You can fly now?!

00:06:37.680 --> 00:06:39.780
There's nothing I can do...

00:06:41.010 --> 00:06:43.180
Just get saved...

00:06:45.480 --> 00:06:47.320
There's really nothing I can do?

00:06:52.060 --> 00:06:56.270
I see. You're changing your strategy, eh?

00:07:00.930 --> 00:07:04.900
If poison doesn't work, 
then physical attacks...

00:07:04.900 --> 00:07:07.670
You'll use that sword 
to cut me up directly...

00:07:07.670 --> 00:07:09.510
...is the idea.

00:07:09.510 --> 00:07:12.380
But that's no easy task either!

00:07:15.880 --> 00:07:19.980
I'm pretty confident in my 
close combat ability too!

00:07:19.980 --> 00:07:23.720
Besides, I'm happy you're 
moving in closer to me.

00:07:23.920 --> 00:07:28.250
Now I'll be able to suck you up!

00:07:36.700 --> 00:07:38.600
Down the hatch!

00:08:14.240 --> 00:08:18.110
Y-You can still stand up?

00:08:20.610 --> 00:08:22.550
I told you before...

00:08:22.550 --> 00:08:24.800
Travel... training...

00:08:25.250 --> 00:08:28.620
...and eating delicious 
food have made me stronger.

00:08:29.270 --> 00:08:30.890
Starjun...

00:08:30.890 --> 00:08:35.620
The last time we met was at Chowlin Temple.

00:08:37.080 --> 00:08:40.290
I've gotten even stronger since then.

00:08:40.870 --> 00:08:44.870
The battle with the Four-Beasts 
made me stronger.

00:08:49.540 --> 00:08:53.210
Still, you weren't as delicious 
as I'd anticipated,

00:08:53.210 --> 00:08:55.070
Coco of the Four Kings.

00:08:55.950 --> 00:08:57.250
Well, of course not.

00:08:59.050 --> 00:09:03.420
That's because you just sucked 
up a dummy I made with poison.

00:09:03.420 --> 00:09:04.620
W-What?!

00:09:04.620 --> 00:09:05.960
When did you...?

00:09:06.590 --> 00:09:08.660
In the battle with the Four-Beasts,

00:09:08.660 --> 00:09:11.730
my power increased several times over.

00:09:12.430 --> 00:09:15.900
The Four-Beasts wasn't an opponent 
that could be beaten by one person.

00:09:16.270 --> 00:09:17.370
But the four of us...

00:09:17.900 --> 00:09:20.240
Me, Coco, Sunny, and Zebra...

00:09:20.730 --> 00:09:24.560
By combining our power and fighting, 
we were able to surpass our limits.

00:09:25.110 --> 00:09:27.710
We did it by working hard together.

00:09:28.010 --> 00:09:29.410
But that ain't all.

00:09:30.250 --> 00:09:32.250
My strength right now...

00:09:33.250 --> 00:09:35.420
...is also thanks to Komatsu's cooking!

00:09:36.550 --> 00:09:40.160
Komatsu cooked Bubble Fruit, Medicinal Mochi,

00:09:40.160 --> 00:09:42.400
and even the Four-Beasts.

00:09:43.490 --> 00:09:45.730
Komatsu's delicious cooking

00:09:46.460 --> 00:09:50.620
activated my Gourmet Cells!

00:09:59.110 --> 00:10:02.050
When I got soaked from the 
Four-Beasts' Green Rain,

00:10:02.050 --> 00:10:04.620
it poisoned me, of all people.

00:10:05.180 --> 00:10:08.420
But I was saved thanks to the 
Medicinal Mochi Komatsu-kun made.

00:10:20.160 --> 00:10:21.930
Just before, you said...

00:10:22.570 --> 00:10:25.240
...that poison doesn't work on you,

00:10:25.240 --> 00:10:28.670
so my new strategy was to 
deal out physical damage.

00:10:29.240 --> 00:10:31.040
That's half-correct.

00:10:31.040 --> 00:10:31.880
Half?

00:10:32.510 --> 00:10:35.510
I wanted to hit you with 
some real firepower...

00:10:35.510 --> 00:10:37.220
...so that's also why I got close!

00:10:37.220 --> 00:10:38.250
Why, you...

00:10:38.250 --> 00:10:40.020
Poison Cannon!

00:10:45.260 --> 00:10:46.280
Yun...

00:10:59.040 --> 00:11:00.000
Are you okay?!

00:11:02.740 --> 00:11:03.570
What was that?

00:11:18.460 --> 00:11:20.820
My Poison Cannon didn't work?!

00:11:20.820 --> 00:11:22.460
No... He swallowed it!

00:11:35.310 --> 00:11:36.240
Coco-san!

00:11:36.540 --> 00:11:37.940
Komatsu-kun!

00:11:39.040 --> 00:11:40.240
Stay back!

00:11:43.270 --> 00:11:44.520
Right now

00:11:44.520 --> 00:11:47.720
I'm radiating extremely dangerous poison.

00:11:48.450 --> 00:11:51.090
Even with Zebra's barrier,

00:11:51.090 --> 00:11:52.290
you mustn't get close to me!

00:11:55.360 --> 00:11:56.720
What is he?

00:11:59.200 --> 00:12:01.400
Not even my deadliest poison works on him...

00:12:08.540 --> 00:12:10.070
Komatsu-kun, run!

00:12:10.740 --> 00:12:12.610
Breath Missile!

00:12:39.000 --> 00:12:40.510
Thank you, Yun!

00:12:47.010 --> 00:12:50.150
The Wall Penguin... You've got 
some mighty fine mobility.

00:12:53.520 --> 00:12:55.790
I can't see the bottom of that hole.

00:12:56.650 --> 00:12:58.890
I've never encountered 
such destructive force,

00:12:58.890 --> 00:13:00.260
nor lung capacity...

00:13:00.260 --> 00:13:02.540
As a creature, he's a very curious specimen.

00:13:02.930 --> 00:13:05.200
That was too close...

00:13:05.200 --> 00:13:09.000
I almost blew away one of 
the chefs accidentally.

00:13:09.400 --> 00:13:12.840
I'll get a scolding from the Head 
Chef if I don't bring 'em back alive!

00:13:14.170 --> 00:13:17.010
I won't let you lay one 
finger on Komatsu-kun!

00:13:17.010 --> 00:13:18.380
C-Coco-san!

00:13:19.710 --> 00:13:21.950
You can stop me?

00:13:35.730 --> 00:13:37.320
Oh, no...

00:14:01.050 --> 00:14:04.520
Now then, I think I'll take you...

00:14:04.520 --> 00:14:06.890
...to the boss.

00:14:08.430 --> 00:14:11.130
Why? Why is Gourmet Corp.

00:14:11.900 --> 00:14:15.130
going this far to capture chefs?

00:14:16.100 --> 00:14:17.150
Why?!

00:14:19.270 --> 00:14:22.210
That's a stupid question, Komatsu-kun.

00:14:22.390 --> 00:14:23.570
Coco-san!

00:14:23.780 --> 00:14:26.380
You're still standing?!

00:14:32.250 --> 00:14:35.620
Why is Gourmet Corp. so eager

00:14:35.620 --> 00:14:37.790
to capture chefs?

00:14:38.690 --> 00:14:41.060
It's because you're all that valuable,

00:14:41.430 --> 00:14:42.750
as chefs.

00:14:43.930 --> 00:14:47.300
In the Gourmet Age, the people 
with the most influence

00:14:47.300 --> 00:14:48.670
aren't politicians...

00:14:49.330 --> 00:14:51.640
...or religious leaders or artists.

00:14:52.370 --> 00:14:53.600
They're chefs.

00:14:54.570 --> 00:14:56.980
One chef being born in the country

00:14:57.980 --> 00:14:59.790
is equivalent to the discovery of oil.

00:15:01.050 --> 00:15:02.610
Compared to chefs,

00:15:02.610 --> 00:15:04.480
even we Gourmet Hunters

00:15:04.480 --> 00:15:06.420
are blown away.

00:15:07.690 --> 00:15:10.150
Even during the old Gourmet War,

00:15:10.150 --> 00:15:12.250
it seems there was a struggle over chefs.

00:15:13.590 --> 00:15:16.730
There are ingredients worth more than 
military power and natural resources.

00:15:17.700 --> 00:15:20.300
And there are those who have 
value that never changes...

00:15:21.030 --> 00:15:22.230
The chefs.

00:15:23.600 --> 00:15:25.500
You understand, don't you, Komatsu-kun?

00:15:26.100 --> 00:15:29.610
You chefs are the treasure of the world.

00:15:33.980 --> 00:15:37.880
That's why Gourmet Corp. is 
desperate to possess you.

00:15:44.110 --> 00:15:45.520
And why we'll

00:15:45.520 --> 00:15:47.860
will put our lives on 
the line to protect you!

00:15:59.000 --> 00:16:00.410
I don't know...

00:16:01.740 --> 00:16:04.310
We chefs are valuable enough for you

00:16:04.310 --> 00:16:05.710
to risk your lives over?

00:16:06.070 --> 00:16:06.970
Yes.

00:16:07.570 --> 00:16:10.530
The food that you and the others 
put so much effort into creating

00:16:11.220 --> 00:16:14.250
satisfies the hunger of 
people all over the world,

00:16:15.250 --> 00:16:18.660
wipes the tears of crying children 
wherever they may be and comforts them...

00:16:20.220 --> 00:16:21.860
...lights up the future...

00:16:22.430 --> 00:16:24.660
...and gives people sun-like warmth

00:16:24.660 --> 00:16:26.320
as well as hope.

00:16:27.470 --> 00:16:29.700
That's why we fight!

00:16:30.370 --> 00:16:31.900
To protect hope!

00:16:33.470 --> 00:16:34.860
Chefs are...

00:16:35.370 --> 00:16:36.500
...hope...

00:16:37.140 --> 00:16:38.640
And I will not let

00:16:39.110 --> 00:16:40.990
Gourmet Corp. take that hope away!

00:16:42.210 --> 00:16:43.160
Coco-san!

00:16:43.780 --> 00:16:48.790
You know, I hate that kind of soapboxing.

00:16:48.920 --> 00:16:52.290
Enough already! I'm gonna 
send you and that hope

00:16:52.290 --> 00:16:53.830
to kingdom come!

00:16:53.830 --> 00:16:55.190
Poison man!

00:16:57.360 --> 00:16:58.830
Go, Komatsu-kun!

00:16:59.210 --> 00:17:01.130
I saw it in my fortune!

00:17:01.770 --> 00:17:04.170
Toriko needs you!

00:17:05.530 --> 00:17:07.840
Go to him as quick as you can!

00:17:08.170 --> 00:17:09.140
Go to Toriko!

00:17:12.280 --> 00:17:13.340
Now!

00:17:13.950 --> 00:17:14.750
Right!

00:17:19.080 --> 00:17:20.950
Breath Missile!

00:17:37.400 --> 00:17:38.600
Coco-san...

00:17:43.510 --> 00:17:44.110
Yun!

00:17:46.080 --> 00:17:47.850
Hey, penguin!

00:17:47.850 --> 00:17:51.020
You look delicious...

00:17:51.020 --> 00:17:55.150
Do you mind if I suck you up?

00:18:00.660 --> 00:18:02.030
You...

00:18:02.030 --> 00:18:03.560
Go, Komatsu-kun!

00:18:03.920 --> 00:18:04.800
Right!

00:18:06.440 --> 00:18:09.460
Now then, let's hang out a while longer.

00:18:10.640 --> 00:18:11.900
But with a change of venue.

00:18:16.870 --> 00:18:20.580
Change of venue?! Where are we going?!

00:18:20.580 --> 00:18:22.410
A place where I can do my worst.

00:18:22.410 --> 00:18:26.780
Or to be more specific, close to 
where the River of Three Hells flows.

00:18:26.780 --> 00:18:29.420
River of Three Hells? What's that?!

00:18:29.990 --> 00:18:31.760
I have to figure out

00:18:31.760 --> 00:18:34.630
his body's immune system.

00:18:34.630 --> 00:18:37.430
And it'll be dangerous for me too,

00:18:37.880 --> 00:18:39.360
but if worse comes to worst,

00:18:39.360 --> 00:18:41.730
I'll have to use that poison!

00:18:47.470 --> 00:18:49.840
What do you think, Starjun?

00:18:49.940 --> 00:18:53.010
Is that all of your power?

00:18:53.010 --> 00:18:54.540
That's it?

00:18:55.110 --> 00:18:56.010
Unfortunate.

00:18:56.220 --> 00:18:56.910
What?!

00:18:57.380 --> 00:19:00.590
You're not the only one 
whose power has increased.

00:19:00.590 --> 00:19:03.150
I'm also not the same 
person that I was before.

00:19:03.760 --> 00:19:06.320
Now it's my turn to give you a feast.

00:19:06.890 --> 00:19:09.190
Eat this!

00:19:24.660 --> 00:19:26.110
Hey...

00:19:26.110 --> 00:19:28.180
What the hell is with this guy?

00:19:29.150 --> 00:19:31.220
Do I have to look at him?

00:19:32.720 --> 00:19:34.820
I suppose I do?

00:19:42.130 --> 00:19:45.360
Gross!

00:19:56.570 --> 00:19:58.180
Disgusting!

00:19:58.180 --> 00:19:59.680
Grody to the max!

00:20:05.050 --> 00:20:08.190
Are you going to die? Tell 
me, are you going to die?

00:20:08.520 --> 00:20:10.420
Like this could kill me, idiot?!

00:20:11.120 --> 00:20:13.420
You know who's gonna die?

00:20:14.460 --> 00:20:18.130
All of you!

00:20:27.710 --> 00:20:33.180
Even in a world that nobody's ever seen

00:20:33.180 --> 00:20:38.880
There's something that can be 
glimpsed if you keep chasing dreams

00:20:38.880 --> 00:20:44.390
Flowers don't bloom on top of asphalt

00:20:44.390 --> 00:20:49.690
Come on, let's go make 
only your dreams come true

00:20:49.690 --> 00:20:55.470
Mega Raba! The map that you 
draw spreads out into infinity

00:20:55.470 --> 00:21:01.210
Mega Raba! Nobody can stop you

00:21:01.210 --> 00:21:07.310
Mega Raba! Let's go forth, 
feeling excitement in our hearts

00:21:07.310 --> 00:21:12.520
Let's go find what you've been longing for

00:21:12.520 --> 00:21:13.980
Mega Raba

00:21:15.450 --> 00:21:16.950
Mega Raba

00:21:18.520 --> 00:21:19.760
Mega Raba

00:21:22.590 --> 00:21:27.570
Guess the Legend
The Legend Gourmet Quiz

00:21:23.530 --> 00:21:25.300
Guess the Legend!

00:21:25.300 --> 00:21:27.280
The Legend Gourmet Quiz!

00:21:28.100 --> 00:21:29.770
I'm your host, Tina.

00:21:29.770 --> 00:21:33.240
This is a heaping helping 
of an epoch-making segment,

00:21:33.240 --> 00:21:36.010
in which you guess the legendary 
ingredients of the Gourmet Age!

00:21:40.180 --> 00:21:46.280
Really?! Level 3

00:21:41.110 --> 00:21:44.250
Today's "Really?!" level is 3.

00:21:44.250 --> 00:21:46.280
Someone once said...

00:21:46.650 --> 00:21:49.590
Heavenly voice! Please help me today too!

00:21:49.590 --> 00:21:53.260
Sure, sure. Okay, here I go.

00:21:53.260 --> 00:21:55.810
Really?! Level 3

00:21:53.420 --> 00:21:56.090
Someone once said...

00:21:56.090 --> 00:21:59.660
There are soft, spongy grapes

00:21:59.660 --> 00:22:02.630
that can even become boiled 
tofu when put in a stew...

00:22:02.630 --> 00:22:05.140
Something something!

00:22:05.140 --> 00:22:07.440
The allotted time limit is 10 seconds.

00:22:07.440 --> 00:22:08.810
Start!

00:22:09.270 --> 00:22:11.510
Grapes that are like tofu?

00:22:11.510 --> 00:22:14.410
Yes. Of course, you can have them raw too,

00:22:14.410 --> 00:22:16.650
but this is the best way to eat them.

00:22:16.650 --> 00:22:18.950
Especially during the cold season...

00:22:20.950 --> 00:22:23.260
Someone once said...

00:22:22.050 --> 00:22:32.800
Tofu Grapes

00:22:23.260 --> 00:22:26.290
There are soft, spongy grapes

00:22:26.290 --> 00:22:29.160
that can even become boiled 
tofu when put in a stew...

00:22:29.160 --> 00:22:32.230
Tofu Grapes!

00:22:32.800 --> 00:22:35.230
They really do look like they'd warm you up!

00:22:35.230 --> 00:22:38.140
I bet Tofu Grapes would 
go great with hot sake.

00:22:38.140 --> 00:22:40.710
Yep. Sake goes great with lots of things...

00:22:41.050 --> 00:22:43.980
And now, let's get back on 
track with our next segment!
